<title>USA: Prime Retail shelf registration effective.</title>
<headline>Prime Retail shelf registration effective.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Retail Inc said Thursday that the shelf registration statement relating to $300 million in aggregate offering price of the company's equity securities has been declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Prime Retail is a self-administered, self-managed real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
